<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115028" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῡσόχο-ος</span></b>  (parox.), ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who melts</i> or <i>casts gold</i>; of <i>one
				who gilds the horns</i> of a sacrificial victim, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.425
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>goldsmith,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				408
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.16
			</span></i>, 
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.658d
			</span></i>; usually uncontracted in 
				Att.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.374.103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.1558.56
			</span></i>, but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῡσοχο-χοῦς</span></b>  ib.<i><span class="en">
				12.347.40
			</span></i>, and so later, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PStrassb.</u>
				92.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, Baillet <i>Inscr.Gr. et Lat.des tombeaux
				des rois</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				1076
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
				i 304
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>.</div>
